{"html":"<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 05 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">自监督学习：对比、聚类、自蒸馏与遮挡重建</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Self-Supervised Learning</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_094_swav-title\">SwAV</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">以在线平衡原型分配作为跨视图预测目标，区别于 BYOL 的 EMA 表示回归和 SimCLR 的实例负样本。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Replaces pairwise instance comparisons with online Sinkhorn-Knopp balanced prototype cluster assignment and swapped cross-view prediction.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">同一图像的两张全局裁剪和若干局部裁剪</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">2 global high-resolution views + M small local crops of the same image</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">可迁移图像表示与在线 prototype 分配</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Transferable visual backbone and online learnable prototype codebook</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 1 · PDF p.4</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始方法示意图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://proceedings.neurips.cc/paper/2020/hash/70feb62b69f16e0238f741fab228fec2-Abstract.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_094_swav')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_094_swav')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"SwAV original paper architecture figure, Figure 1\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/c9a8fab7e0f96876cbc3.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 1 · PDF p.4</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 7 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_094_swav', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_094_swav\" data-call-click=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_094_swav')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_094_swav', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_094_swav\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 07 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">Multi-crop views</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Multi-crop views</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">高分辨率全局视图配合低分辨率局部视图扩大上下文组合</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests 2 global high-resolution views + m small local crops of the same image and prepares initial tensor representations (Multi-crop views).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"高分辨率全局视图配合低分辨率局部视图扩大上下文组合\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests 2 global high-resolution views + m small local crops of the same image and prepares initial tensor representations (Multi-crop views).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"Multi-crop views\" data-node-name-en=\"Multi-crop views\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_094_swav', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Multi-crop views</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">高分辨率全局视图配合低分辨率局部视图扩大上下文组合</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests 2 global high-resolution views + m small local crops of the same image and prepares initial tensor representations (Multi-crop views).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"各视图共享 ResNet 等主干\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes ConvNet encoder to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"共享 ConvNet encoder\" data-node-name-en=\"ConvNet encoder\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_094_swav', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">共享 ConvNet encoder</span><span class=\"lang-en\">ConvNet encoder</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">各视图共享 ResNet 等主干</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes ConvNet encoder to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"得到适合原型匹配的单位向量\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs projection L2 normalization within the core online prototype swapped clustering computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"投影与 L2 归一化\" data-node-name-en=\"projection L2 normalization\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_094_swav', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">投影与 L2 归一化</span><span class=\"lang-en\">projection L2 normalization</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">得到适合原型匹配的单位向量</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs projection L2 normalization within the core online prototype swapped clustering computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"特征与原型点积形成聚类 logits\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs prototypes within the core online prototype swapped clustering computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"可学习 prototypes\" data-node-name-en=\"prototypes\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_094_swav', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">可学习 prototypes</span><span class=\"lang-en\">prototypes</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">特征与原型点积形成聚类 logits</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs prototypes within the core online prototype swapped clustering computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"对全局视图求近似均衡的在线软聚类码\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Sinkhorn-Knopp within the core online prototype swapped clustering computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"Sinkhorn-Knopp 分配\" data-node-name-en=\"Sinkhorn-Knopp\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_094_swav', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">Sinkhorn-Knopp 分配</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Sinkhorn-Knopp</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">对全局视图求近似均衡的在线软聚类码</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Sinkhorn-Knopp within the core online prototype swapped clustering computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"一视图预测另一视图的 prototype 分配\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies Swapped prediction loss to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"Swapped prediction loss\" data-node-name-en=\"Swapped prediction loss\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_094_swav', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Swapped prediction loss</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">一视图预测另一视图的 prototype 分配</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies Swapped prediction loss to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"下游复用共享 encoder\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces transferable visual backbone and online learnable prototype codebook via pretraining.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"预训练表示\" data-node-name-en=\"pretraining\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_094_swav', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">预训练表示</span><span class=\"lang-en\">pretraining</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">下游复用共享 encoder</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces transferable visual backbone and online learnable prototype codebook via pretraining.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"SwAV Mathematic